# Internal dev artifacts (hidden from client-facing repo tree, kept local)
# NOTE: these folders still exist on disk, they are just not tracked.
# The leading slash restricts the match to the repo root, so
# `backend/tests/`, `backend/specs/`, etc. are NOT affected.
/.kiro/
/ai-memory/
/ai-system/
/evaluation/
/specs/
/tests/
/api/
/N8N WorkFlows/
/plugins/
/packages/

# Stale top-level docs (superseded by docs/ folder).
# Leading slash restricts these to the repo root, so docs/DEMO_SCRIPT.md
# etc. are not affected by these rules.
/ARCHITECTURE.md
/API_CONTRACT.md
/DEMO_SCRIPT.md
/PROJECT_SUMMARY.md

# CLAUDE.md — stays on disk for Claude Code to read, but not committed
